Jackson, Robert Forster, Bridget Fonda, Michael Keaton and Robert De Niro.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
In the film, Jackie Brown (Grier), a flight attendant, becomes embroiled in a
battle to smuggle money between the United States and Mexico.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
Jackie Brown pays homage to 1970s blaxploitation films, particularly
Coffy and Foxy Brown, both of which also starred Grier.

16
